{"steam_appid":3124550,"steam_name":"Liquor Store Simulator","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3124550/883128/e795b5f7de55c7bb8869d16c35e4eb9c9fc773da/1750823875/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1746186413","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257134240/bed6f94a4148cdf96abbd3ad42fb8316dc095ab6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746186413","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124550/923ad8ed3143bc1304a547d78e3e940cc2509321/ss_923ad8ed3143bc1304a547d78e3e940cc2509321.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785754383","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124550/b19e46f0d8dab05e62f3706a6f61e589b21c029b/ss_b19e46f0d8dab05e62f3706a6f61e589b21c029b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785754383","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124550/cdb216c865683fbb84427253fde8b619ebf4ae77/ss_cdb216c865683fbb84427253fde8b619ebf4ae77.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785754383","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124550/bce5eb34409c12af02d3d658960f20d3d692f374/ss_bce5eb34409c12af02d3d658960f20d3d692f374.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785754383","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124550/1afd2d7ec393aab9f52638d7a0aa73be131497b3/ss_1afd2d7ec393aab9f52638d7a0aa73be131497b3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785754383"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Liquor Store Simulator</strong> is a simulation game about developing your own store. You start your business in a small shop that you bought on credit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, it won’t be easy—you’ll have to work at the checkout yourself, accept deliveries, keep records, and maintain order in the sales area. But hard work and smart decisions will help you turn a modest retail outlet into a thriving store with a wide selection and satisfied customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase goods, arrange retail equipment as you see fit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124550/extras/55b1e130389f1057d61c74d4bf21d717.poster.avif?t=1785754383\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124550/extras/55b1e130389f1057d61c74d4bf21d717.webm?t=1785754383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124550/extras/55b1e130389f1057d61c74d4bf21d717.mp4?t=1785754383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Draft Beer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel like a bartender. Pour customers the beer they desire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124550/extras/5a2390a76eaf0efd606215416cb77014.poster.avif?t=1785754383\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124550/extras/5a2390a76eaf0efd606215416cb77014.webm?t=1785754383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124550/extras/5a2390a76eaf0efd606215416cb77014.mp4?t=1785754383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Staff Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, you’ll have to do everything yourself. But as your store grows, you won’t be able to handle it alone. Hire employees for efficient store management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124550/extras/491a14129193751637ed384230481fb9.poster.avif?t=1785754383\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124550/extras/491a14129193751637ed384230481fb9.webm?t=1785754383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124550/extras/491a14129193751637ed384230481fb9.mp4?t=1785754383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the color of walls, ceilings, and floors. Make your store unique and unlike any other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124550/extras/4b679d47db83e2236f84c5725a7e2268.poster.avif?t=1785754383\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124550/extras/4b679d47db83e2236f84c5725a7e2268.webm?t=1785754383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124550/extras/4b679d47db83e2236f84c5725a7e2268.mp4?t=1785754383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 4690 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 Ti 4GB or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® i5-8700k / AMD Ryzen 7 1700X equivalent or greater<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVidia GeForce GTX 1070 8GB / AMD RX 580 8GB or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie","Simulation"],"developers":["Tovarishch Games"],"publishers":["PlayWay S.A."],"release_date":"2 May, 2025"}